936
00:45:07,052 --> 00:45:08,357
[pria] Mm-hmm.

937
00:45:08,531 --> 00:45:10,011
[Ben] Di luar jaringan, kalau kau mengerti maksudku.

938
00:45:10,185 --> 00:45:11,752
[pria] Oh, begitu ya?

939
00:45:11,926 --> 00:45:13,101
[Ben] Aku akan memberimu seratus dolar untuk kamarmu

940
00:45:13,275 --> 00:45:15,103
